msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:20
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Creates the repositories, drains the open PRs until the source settles, seeds both repositories, has the parent consume the pair additively, makes the first release and checks every identifier dereferences. Nothing is seeded on an unknown readiness. Called by kg-separation, on its bean (bpmn-authoring: split by phase)."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:73
